*** Test Cases ***

[1][1.0] CB008533-5G-AB4-1_4CC_buffer_based_Scells_2stepsActiv_DL_nonGBR_data_split_over_Pcell_and_3_Scell_2F+2T
        [Documentation]
        ...  The purpose of this test is to check the successful call setup with
        ...  FDD – TDD FR1 DL CA 4CC (F+F+T+T) for the single UE with dynamic flow control,
        ...  data split over PCell and 3 SCells, with blind SCells addition
        ...  and buffer based SCells activation without beamforming on TDD FR1 SCells
        ...
        ...  4.1 Preconditions
        ...  - NRBTS/NRDU.actInterNumerologyCa = True
        ...  - NRBTS/NRDU.flexibleCAMode = 2 (ConfigurationIndependent)
        ...  - NRBTS/NRDU.actConnectedModeMobilityCA = True
        ...  - NRBTS/NRCELL/maxNumSCellsDlFr1 = 3
        ...  - NRBTS/NRDU.carrierAggregationSupportList contains elements equal to 200 (ca_Fdd_Fr1Tdd_Sa) and 3 (ca_Fdd_Fdd) and 600 (ca_Fdd_Any_Sa)
        ...  - NRBTS/NRCELL.cellDepType is set to 1 (SA) or 2 (SANSA)
        ...  - Cell configuration :
        ...  C1 : band 41 BW 60 Mhz TDD. 
        ...  C2 : band 78 BW 100 Mhz TDD. 
        ...  C3 : band 71 BW 10 Mhz FDD. 
        ...  C4 : band 71 BW 20 Mhz FDD. 
        ...  C5 : band 25 BW 20 Mhz FDD. 
        ...  C6 : band 66 BW 20 Mhz FDD. 
        ...  
        ...  Different non-contigous NRARFCN for cells 3 and 4
        ...  
        ...  FDD PCell (Cell 3) 
        ...  • Cell 3 has NRRELs that points to 
        ...  • Cell 1 
        ...  • Cell 2 
        ...  • Cell 5
        ...  • Cell 6
        ...  - SCell weights (NRBTS/NRCELL/weightForSCellSelection) are configured as below:
        ...  - Cell 2 (TDD) > Cell 1 (TDD) > Cell 5 (FDD) > Cell 6 (FDD)
        ...  
        ...  - NRBTS/NRCELL.iniNumSCellsToActivate = 2
        ...  - each object NRBTS/NRCELL/NRREL.sCellAdditionMethod parameter is set it to 0 (blind)
        ...  - NRBTS.sCellActivationMethod = 1 (bufferBased)
        ...  - NRBTS/NRCELL.actCDrx = False
        ...  - NRBTS.actLteNrDss = false
        ...  - NRBTS.NRCELL.actAperCsi = True
        ...  - TDD cells are configured with subframe configuration according to 5GC001116-B
        ...  - NRBTS/NRCELL.actBeamforming = False
        ...  - NRBTS/NRCELL.dlMimoMode <> 70 (8x4 Closed Loop Spatial Multiplexing)
        ...  - NRBTS.actFdmScheduling = true
        ...  - NRBTS/NRCELL.actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot = true

        TC 8533-AB401    ${TC8533_AB401}
        